[I] Window manager and compositor library of Budgie

[T] Magpie is the X11 window manager and compositor library of the Budgie
[T] Desktop, a fork of Mutter. It handles window management, compositing,
[T] focus tracking, workspaces, keybindings and monitor configuration.

[U] https://buddiesofbudgie.org/

[A] Budgie Desktop Developers
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/desktop/gnome

[L] MPL
[V] 0.9.4

[D] ac55fe1c033d2fb0aa79d70fad35841b46674a8f34d1df86c23c8032 magpie-0.9.4.tar.gz https://github.com/BuddiesOfBudgie/magpie/archive/refs/tags/v0.9.4/

pkginstalled systemd || var_append mesonopt ' ' -Dsystemd=false
pkginstalled udev || var_append mesonopt ' ' -Dudev=false
